{"t":"Tainted Caves","s":"tainted-caves-408b8","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Tainted_Soul_68661f.gif","q":2,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Tainted Caves</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Tainted Soul\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Tainted_Soul_68661f.gif\" width=\"64\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"city\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Near city</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Venore\">Venore</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"location\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Location</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">North in <a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Claw%20Swamp\">Green Claw Swamp</a>, entrance <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32711,31939,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32711, 31939, 7)</a>.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"vocation\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Vocation(s)</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">All vocations.</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">10.80<br/>July 21, 2015<br/>Summer Update 2015</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The <b>Tainted Caves</b> are some caves north in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Claw%20Swamp\">Green Claw Swamp</a>, not very far north-east of the Dwarven Bridge, accessed <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32711,31939,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32711, 31939, 7)</a>.\n</p><p><a href=\"#/quest/the-tainted-souls-quest\">The Tainted Souls Quest</a> takes place here, where the quest involves killing <a href=\"#/wiki/Ekatrix\">Ekatrix</a>. The Swamp of Lost Souls is also one location you must cartograph during the <a href=\"#/quest/cartography-101-quest\">Cartography 101 Quest</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures\">Creatures</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Surface\">Surface</span></h3>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Tainted%20Soul\"><img alt=\"Tainted Soul\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Tainted_Soul_68661f.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Tainted%20Soul\">Tainted Soul</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">0</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">250</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">78 + 25 mana</td><td style=\"font-siz